{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1539389-agonism","id":1539389,"title":"Agonism","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-27T13:45:11-07:00","id":1539389,"title":"Agonism","content":"I love Agonism and its derivative systems (One Candle Lights Another, Staged Struggle).<br /> The basic effect - whenever one character puts a subplot on hold so another character's subplot can advance, the first character's player gets a benefit - is good for keeping conflict around the table in character, but what I really like about it is what it says about the world of the game.<br /> It has so much <i>optimism</i>. Not the kind with wide eyes, the kind with gritted teeth. By using your words, taking risks for others, deserving trust, and just generally behaving like a human being should, you can stack up truly enormous teamwork bonuses.<br /> Love and trust <i>can </i>counter super weight. (Sometimes, maybe.)<br /> It's great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28549-sikander","name":"Sikander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-27T14:32:11-07:00","id":1539391,"title":"","content":"Aren't all your posts out of control dude? I swear there's a new thread or 3 ever day","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:",